<title>USA: Greenfield, Wis., won by First of America.</title>
<headline>Greenfield, Wis., won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America said it won $4.115 million of Greenfield, Wis., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 4.32 percent.</p>
</text>
